{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33054","headline":"和谢豫章从宋公戏马台送孔令谢病 · 曹邺","name":"和谢豫章从宋公戏马台送孔令谢病","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧树杳云暮，朔风自西来。\n佳人忆山水，置酒在高台。\n不必问流水，坐来日已西。\n劝君速归去，正及鹧鸪啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}